## Common Mistakes to Avoid

❌ Using `react-native` StatusBar instead of `expo-status-bar`
❌ Mixing `style` prop with NativeWind `className` unnecessarily
❌ Forgetting `SafeAreaProvider` wrapper
❌ Using old NativeWind v2/v3 patterns (styled() function)
❌ Not hiding splash screen after fonts load
❌ Importing fonts directly instead of via @expo-google-fonts packages
